@startuml gateway-trust-boundary-sequence
!theme plain
autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title API GATEWAY - CƠ CHẾ BẢO VỆ RANH GIỚI TIN CẬY (TRUST BOUNDARY FILTER)

actor "Attacker / Malicious Client" as BadClient
actor "Legitimate Customer" as GoodClient
participant "GatewayTrustBoundaryFilter" as Filter
participant "RoutePredicateHandler" as Router
participant "Downstream Microservice\n(Ví dụ: Order Service)" as Service

== KỊCH BẢN 1: ATTACKER CỐ TÌNH CHÈN HEADER NỘI BỘ GIẢ MẠO ==
BadClient -> Filter: POST /api/v1/orders\nHeaders:\n- X-Internal-Service-Key: "HACKED_KEY"\n- X-Actor-Grants: "SUPER_ADMIN,ORDER_OVERRIDE"\n- Authorization: Bearer <FakeToken>
activate Filter

Filter -> Filter: Phát hiện các Header thuộc danh sách cấm (Forbidden Internal Headers):\n- X-Internal-Service-Key\n- X-Actor-Grants
Filter -> Filter: mutate().headers(httpHeaders -> {\n  httpHeaders.remove("X-Internal-Service-Key");\n  httpHeaders.remove("X-Actor-Grants");\n  httpHeaders.set("X-Request-Id", UUID.randomUUID().toString());\n})

Filter -> Router: Forward sanitized request (Headers nội bộ đã bị loại bỏ hoàn toàn!)
activate Router

Router -> Service: Forward POST /api/v1/orders (Chỉ còn Authorization Bearer)
activate Service

Service -> Service: Introspect Bearer Token với Identity Service
Service --> Router: 401 Unauthorized ("Token không hợp lệ")
deactivate Service

Router --> Filter: 401 Unauthorized
deactivate Router

Filter --> BadClient: 401 Unauthorized (Tấn công leo thang đặc quyền thất bại!)
deactivate Filter

== KỊCH BẢN 2: REQUEST HỢP LỆ TỪ KHÁCH HÀNG ==
GoodClient -> Filter: GET /api/products/202\nHeaders:\n- Authorization: Bearer <ValidJwtToken>
activate Filter

Filter -> Filter: Kiểm tra Header: Không có header cấm\nBổ sung Header X-Request-Id: "req-98765"
Filter -> Router: Forward sanitized request
activate Router

Router -> Service: Forward GET /api/products/202
activate Service
Service --> Router: 200 OK [Product Data]
deactivate Service

Router --> Filter: 200 OK [Product Data]
deactivate Router

Filter --> GoodClient: 200 OK (Kèm Header Exposed: X-Request-Id)
deactivate Filter

@enduml
